A member function template with an explicit object parameter was rejected
for a const object: the check that a const object needs a const member
function (member_template_object_viable) applied, though such a member
has no implicit object parameter.  GCC 16's ranges adaptor
_Partial::operator()(this _Self&&, _Range&&) for a const adaptor.
